msgstr "0"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:181
msgid "logins, apps or names asked of them"
msgstr "connexion, appli ou nom demandés"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:196
msgid "Try it: tap an answer"
msgstr "Essayez : touchez une réponse"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:209
#: app/templates/consultations/participate.html:46
#, python-format
msgid "Statement %(current)s of %(total)s"
msgstr "Affirmation %(current)s sur %(total)s"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:226
msgid "You said agree."
msgstr "Vous avez répondu d’accord."

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:227
#, python-format
msgid "You said disagree."
msgstr "Vous avez répondu pas d’accord."

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:228
msgid "You said unsure."
msgstr "Vous avez répondu pas sûr."

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:229
#, python-format
msgid "Here is how %(num)d member answered in our example:"
msgid_plural "Here is how %(num)d members answered in our example:"
msgstr[0] "Voici comment %(num)d membre a répondu dans notre exemple :"
msgstr[1] "Voici comment %(num)d membres ont répondu dans notre exemple :"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:235
msgid "A clear majority. This is ground you can build on."
msgstr ""
"Une nette majorité. C’est un terrain sur lequel vous pouvez construire."

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:236
msgid "A clear majority against. An idea you can drop."
msgstr "Une nette majorité contre. Une idée que vous pouvez abandonner."

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:237
msgid "Most people do not know yet. They need information, not a vote."
msgstr ""
"La plupart des gens ne savent pas encore. Ils ont besoin d’informations, pas"
" d’un vote."

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:238
msgid "Both sides are large and close. A real division, not indecision."
msgstr ""
"Les deux camps sont importants et proches. Une vraie division, pas de "
"l’indécision."

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:241
msgid "See what you get back"
msgstr "Voir ce que vous obtenez"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:241
msgid "Next statement"
msgstr "Affirmation suivante"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:249
msgid "Four taps, four kinds of finding."
msgstr "Quatre gestes, quatre types de constat."

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:250
msgid ""
"The report sorts every statement the same way, so you can see at a glance "
"what to act on."
msgstr ""
"Le rapport classe chaque affirmation de la même manière, pour que vous "
"voyiez d’un coup d’œil sur quoi agir."

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:259
msgid "Read the full report"
msgstr "Lire le rapport complet"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:260
#: app/templates/consultations/participate.html:89
msgid "Go through it again"
msgstr "Recommencer"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:265
msgid "A made-up example. Nothing you tap is recorded."
msgstr "Un exemple fictif. Rien de ce que vous touchez n’est enregistré."

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:266
msgid "Answer all twelve on your phone"
msgstr "Répondez aux douze sur votre téléphone"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:276
msgid "From question to report in three steps"
msgstr "De la question au rapport en trois étapes"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:277
msgid ""
"A consultation is one question, about a dozen short statements that people "
"agree or disagree with, and the report that comes out of their answers."
msgstr ""
"Une consultation, c’est une question, une douzaine de courtes affirmations "
"avec lesquelles les gens sont d’accord ou non, et le rapport qui résulte de "
"leurs réponses."

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:286
msgid "Drafted for you"
msgstr "Rédigé pour vous"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:298
#: app/templates/consultations/start.html:37
msgid "Ask your question"
msgstr "Posez votre question"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:299
msgid ""
"Tell us what you want to know. We draft a balanced set of short statements. "
"Edit them, remove them, add your own, or write them all yourself."
msgstr ""
"Dites-nous ce que vous voulez savoir. Nous rédigeons un ensemble équilibré "
"de courtes affirmations. Modifiez-les, retirez-les, ajoutez les vôtres, ou "
"rédigez-les toutes vous-même."

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:300
msgid "About five minutes."
msgstr "Environ cinq minutes."

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:319
#: app/templates/consultations/start.html:39
msgid "Share a link or QR code"
msgstr "Partagez un lien ou un code QR"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:320
msgid ""
"People answer Agree, Disagree or Unsure, one statement at a time. No login, "
"no app, nothing to install."
msgstr ""
"Les gens répondent D’accord, Pas d’accord ou Pas sûr, une affirmation à la "
"fois. Sans connexion, sans appli, rien à installer."

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:321
msgid "About two minutes each."
msgstr "Environ deux minutes chacun."

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:341
msgid "Get the report"
msgstr "Recevez le rapport"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:342
msgid ""
"What they agree on, what they reject, where they are unsure and where they "
"are split, with the numbers and the statements behind each finding."
msgstr ""
"Ce sur quoi ils s’accordent, ce qu’ils rejettent, où ils sont indécis et où "
"ils sont partagés, avec les chiffres et les affirmations derrière chaque "
"constat."

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:343
msgid "Built the moment voting closes."
msgstr "Généré dès la clôture du vote."

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:354
msgid "What the data looks like"
msgstr "À quoi ressemblent les données"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:355
msgid "A poll gives you a number. This gives you the picture."
msgstr "Un sondage vous donne un chiffre. Ceci vous donne le tableau."

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:356
msgid ""
"A poll answers the question you thought to ask. A consultation covers your "
"question from a dozen angles and sorts every statement into one of four "
"findings."
msgstr ""
"Un sondage répond à la question que vous avez pensé à poser. Une "
"consultation aborde votre question sous une douzaine d’angles et classe "
"chaque affirmation dans l’un des quatre constats."

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:361
msgid "A poll"
msgstr "Un sondage"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:362
msgid "Should we spend the surplus?"
msgstr "Devrions-nous dépenser l’excédent ?"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:367
#: app/templates/trending/topic_detail.html:46
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Oui"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:367
#: app/templates/help/native_system.html:449
#: app/templates/help/native_system.html:454
#: app/templates/help/native_system.html:464
#: app/templates/trending/topic_detail.html:46
msgid "No"
msgstr "Non"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:368
msgid ""
"Spend it on what? Who decides? Is the minority opposed, or just not told "
"enough? The number cannot say."
msgstr ""
"Le dépenser pour quoi ? Qui décide ? La minorité est-elle opposée, ou "
"simplement pas assez informée ? Le chiffre ne le dit pas."

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:373
msgid "A consultation"
msgstr "Une consultation"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:374
#, python-format
msgid "%(num)d member, twelve statements"
msgid_plural "%(num)d members, twelve statements"
msgstr[0] "%(num)d membre, douze affirmations"
msgstr[1] "%(num)d membres, douze affirmations"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:390
msgid "agree, then disagree:"
msgstr "d’accord, puis pas d’accord :"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:402
msgid ""
"Illustration with made-up votes, sorted by the same rules as a real report."
msgstr ""
"Illustration avec des votes fictifs, classés selon les mêmes règles qu’un "
"vrai rapport."

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:407
msgid "Four findings, and what each lets you do"
msgstr "Quatre constats, et ce que chacun vous permet de faire"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:410
msgid "Where they agree"
msgstr "Là où ils sont d’accord"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:410
msgid "The ground you can build on. Often more than you expected."
msgstr ""
"Le terrain sur lequel construire. Souvent plus que vous ne l’imaginiez."

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:410
msgid "Act on it"
msgstr "Agissez"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:410
msgid "Announce it, build on it, and stop re-arguing it."
msgstr "Annoncez-le, construisez dessus et cessez de le rediscuter."

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:411
msgid "Where they disagree"
msgstr "Là où ils ne sont pas d’accord"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:411
msgid "The ideas your audience has clearly rejected."
msgstr "Les idées que votre public a clairement rejetées."

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:411
msgid "Drop it"
msgstr "Abandonnez"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:411
msgid "Take it off the agenda, and say that you have."
msgstr "Retirez-le de l’ordre du jour, et dites que vous l’avez fait."

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:412
msgid "Where they are unsure"
msgstr "Là où ils sont indécis"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:412
msgid "Where people need more information before they can take a view."
msgstr ""
"Là où les gens ont besoin de plus d’informations avant de pouvoir se faire "
"un avis."

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:412
msgid "Explain it"
msgstr "Expliquez"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:412
msgid "Give people the facts they are missing, then ask again."
msgstr ""
"Donnez aux gens les faits qui leur manquent, puis reposez la question."

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:413
msgid "Where they are split"
msgstr "Là où ils sont partagés"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:413
msgid "The real divisions, which are different from not knowing."
msgstr "Les vraies divisions, qui diffèrent de l’ignorance."

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:413
msgid "Explore it"
msgstr "Explorez"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:413
msgid "Do not force a vote. Find out what each side is worried about."
msgstr "Ne forcez pas un vote. Découvrez ce qui inquiète chaque camp."

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:429
msgid ""
"The report also suggests what to ask next, clearly marked as suggestions. It"
" does not tell you what to do, and it says plainly how many people took part"
" and what the results do not show."
msgstr ""
"Le rapport suggère aussi quoi demander ensuite, clairement présenté comme "
"des suggestions. Il ne vous dit pas quoi faire, et il indique sans détour "
"combien de personnes ont participé et ce que les résultats ne montrent pas."

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:445
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "Exemples"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:446
msgid "Use it when you need to know where people stand"
msgstr "À utiliser quand vous avez besoin de savoir où les gens se situent"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:447
msgid ""
"Six situations you may recognise: the question each organisation asked, what"
" it found, and what that let it do next."
msgstr ""
"Six situations que vous reconnaîtrez peut-être : la question posée par "
"chaque organisation, ce qu’elle a trouvé, et ce que cela lui a permis de "
"faire ensuite."

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:450
msgid "Kinds of organisation"
msgstr "Types d’organisation"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:470
msgid "The situation"
msgstr "La situation"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:472
msgid "The question"
msgstr "La question"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:476
msgid "Shared"
msgstr "Partagé"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:486
msgid "What they found"
msgstr "Ce qu’ils ont trouvé"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:498
msgid "What it lets you do:"
msgstr "Ce que cela vous permet de faire :"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:509
msgid ""
"Made-up examples, not customer results. The figures are sorted into findings"
" by the same rules as a real report."
msgstr ""
"Exemples fictifs, et non des résultats de clients. Les chiffres sont classés"
" en constats selon les mêmes règles qu’un vrai rapport."

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:519
msgid "Live audiences"
msgstr "Publics en direct"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:520
msgid ""
"Put the code on a slide. Know where the room stands before the session ends."
msgstr ""
"Mettez le code sur une diapositive. Sachez où en est la salle avant la fin "
"de la session."

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:521
msgid ""
"A show of hands tells you who is confident. This tells you what everyone "
"thinks, including the people who would never raise a hand."
msgstr ""
"Un vote à main levée vous dit qui est sûr de lui. Ceci vous dit ce que pense"
" tout le monde, y compris ceux qui ne lèveraient jamais la main."

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:522
msgid ""
"Each talk is its own question and its own report. A 30-day pass covers every"
" talk you run in that time."
msgstr ""
"Chaque intervention est sa propre question et son propre rapport. Un pass de"
" 30 jours couvre toutes les interventions que vous animez pendant cette "
"période."

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:525
msgid "0:00"
msgstr "0:00"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:525
msgid "The code goes on screen"
msgstr "Le code s’affiche à l’écran"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:525
msgid ""
"One click opens a full-screen view with your question, the QR code and a "
"live count of who has answered."
msgstr ""
"Un clic ouvre un affichage plein écran avec votre question, le code QR et le"
" décompte en direct de ceux qui ont répondu."

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:526
msgid "0:30"
msgstr "0:30"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:526
msgid "The room starts answering"
msgstr "La salle commence à répondre"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:526
msgid ""
"No login and no app, so nobody is left behind. One tap per statement, and it"
" is anonymous."
msgstr ""
"Sans connexion ni appli, personne n’est laissé de côté. Un geste par "
"affirmation, et c’est anonyme."

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:527
msgid "2:00"
msgstr "2:00"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:527
msgid "Reveal the results on the same screen"
msgstr "Dévoilez les résultats sur le même écran"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:527
msgid ""
"One key switches from the code to the results, sorted into the four "
"findings. You choose the moment, so nobody is swayed while they are still "
"answering."
msgstr ""
"Une touche fait passer du code aux résultats, classés selon les quatre "
"constats. Vous choisissez le moment, pour que personne ne soit influencé "
"pendant qu’il répond encore."

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:528
msgid "After"
msgstr "Après"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:528
msgid "Close voting and the report is built"
msgstr "Clôturez le vote et le rapport est généré"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:528
msgid "Read the headline out before people leave, then send the link round."
msgstr ""
"Lisez le titre à voix haute avant que les gens ne partent, puis envoyez le "
"lien."

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:540
msgid "Let the room add to it."
msgstr "Laissez la salle compléter."

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:541
msgid ""
"Switch on suggestions and people can propose statements of their own. Each "
"one waits for your approval before anyone else sees it."
msgstr ""
"Activez les suggestions et les gens pourront proposer leurs propres "
"affirmations. Chacune attend votre validation avant que quiconque d’autre la"
" voie."

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:547
msgid "Annual conference"
msgstr "Conférence annuelle"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:550
#: app/templates/consultations/present.html:39
msgid "Point your phone camera at the code"
msgstr "Pointez l’appareil photo de votre téléphone vers le code"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:551
#: app/templates/consultations/present.html:42
msgid "Two minutes. No login. Anonymous."
msgstr "Deux minutes. Sans connexion. Anonyme."

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:558
#, python-format
msgid "%(num)d person answered"
msgid_plural "%(num)d people answered"
msgstr[0] "%(num)d personne a répondu"
msgstr[1] "%(num)d personnes ont répondu"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:558
msgid "answered"
msgstr "ont répondu"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:570
msgid "Illustration: one dot for each person in a made-up room."
msgstr "Illustration : un point pour chaque personne dans une salle fictive."

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:579
msgid "What you get back"
msgstr "Ce que vous recevez"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:580
msgid "A report you can forward, not a spreadsheet to decode"
msgstr "Un rapport que vous pouvez transmettre, pas un tableur à décoder"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:581
msgid ""
"Written in plain English, with every number counted directly from the votes."
" Send it to your board as it is."
msgstr ""
"Rédigé en langage clair, avec chaque chiffre compté directement à partir des"
" votes. Envoyez-le tel quel à votre conseil."

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:631
msgid "Illustration. Your report is built from your own audience’s answers."
msgstr ""
"Illustration. Votre rapport est généré à partir des réponses de votre propre"
" public."

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:637
msgid "A headline you can read out"
msgstr "Un titre que vous pouvez lire à voix haute"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:637
msgid ""
"One sentence that says where your audience stands. Written by AI from the "
"results, then checked by software so it adds nothing the votes do not show."
msgstr ""
"Une phrase qui dit où en est votre public. Rédigée par une IA à partir des "
"résultats, puis vérifiée par un logiciel pour qu’elle n’ajoute rien que les "
"votes ne montrent pas."

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:638
msgid "The four findings, counted"
msgstr "Les quatre constats, chiffrés"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:638
msgid ""
"How many statements they agree with, reject, are unsure about or are split "
"on."
msgstr ""
"Combien d’affirmations ils approuvent, rejettent, sur lesquelles ils sont "
"indécis ou partagés."

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:639
msgid "Themes, not a wall of charts"
msgstr "Des thèmes, pas un mur de graphiques"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:639
msgid "Related statements are grouped, so a pattern reads as one finding."
msgstr ""
"Les affirmations liées sont regroupées, pour qu’une tendance se lise comme "
"un seul constat."

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:640
msgid "Every statement, with its numbers"
msgstr "Chaque affirmation, avec ses chiffres"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:640
msgid ""
"The evidence behind each finding, and a plain account of how many people "
"took part and what the results do not show."
msgstr ""
"Les preuves derrière chaque constat, et un exposé clair du nombre de "
"personnes qui ont participé et de ce que les résultats ne montrent pas."

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:652
msgid "Then put it to work"
msgstr "Puis mettez-le à profit"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:655
msgid "Share by link"
msgstr "Partager par lien"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:655
msgid "Private until you choose to share it."
msgstr "Privé jusqu’à ce que vous choisissiez de le partager."

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:656
msgid "Download the PDF"
msgstr "Télécharger le PDF"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:656
msgid "For the board pack or the minutes."
msgstr "Pour le dossier du conseil ou le procès-verbal."

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:657
msgid "Export the CSV"
msgstr "Exporter le CSV"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:657
msgid "Every figure, for your own analysis."
msgstr "Chaque chiffre, pour votre propre analyse."

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:658
msgid "Ask the next question"
msgstr "Poser la question suivante"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:658
msgid "The report suggests what to ask next."
msgstr "Le rapport suggère quoi demander ensuite."

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:671
msgid "See the example report"
msgstr "Voir l’exemple de rapport"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:672
msgid "Answer it as a participant"
msgstr "Y répondre en tant que participant"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:683
msgid "Why this, not that"
msgstr "Pourquoi ceci plutôt que cela"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:684
msgid "Why not a survey or a live poll?"
msgstr "Pourquoi pas un questionnaire ou un sondage en direct ?"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:685
msgid ""
"They are good tools, and for some jobs the better choice. None of them hands"
" you a finished account of where a group stands."
msgstr ""
"Ce sont de bons outils, et pour certaines tâches le meilleur choix. Aucun ne"
" vous remet un compte rendu abouti de la position d’un groupe."

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:690
msgid "Built for"
msgstr "Conçu pour"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:690
msgid "Live Q&A, quick polls and quizzes in a meeting"
msgstr "Questions-réponses en direct, sondages rapides et quiz en réunion"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:690
msgid "Interactive slides: word clouds, quizzes and polls"
msgstr "Diapositives interactives : nuages de mots, quiz et sondages"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:690
msgid "Long questionnaires with branching and written answers"
msgstr "Longs questionnaires avec embranchements et réponses rédigées"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:690
msgid "Finding where a group stands on one contested question"
msgstr "Savoir où se situe un groupe sur une question disputée"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:691
msgid "You prepare"
msgstr "Vous préparez"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:691
msgid "Each poll and its options"
msgstr "Chaque sondage et ses options"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:691
msgid "A slide for each question"
msgstr "Une diapositive par question"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:691
msgid "Every question, written and tested"
msgstr "Chaque question, rédigée et testée"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:691
msgid "One question. The statements are drafted for you to edit"
msgstr ""
"Une question. Les affirmations sont rédigées pour que vous les modifiiez"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:692
msgid "You walk away with"
msgstr "Vous repartez avec"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:692
msgid "A chart for each poll, and an export"
msgstr "Un graphique par sondage, et un export"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:692
msgid "A chart for each slide, and an export"
msgstr "Un graphique par diapositive, et un export"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:692
msgid "A spreadsheet and charts to interpret"
msgstr "Un tableur et des graphiques à interpréter"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:692
msgid "A written report you can forward as it is"
msgstr "Un rapport rédigé que vous pouvez transmettre tel quel"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:693
msgid "Divided, or just undecided?"
msgstr "Partagés, ou simplement indécis ?"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:693
msgid "Yours to work out from the charts"
msgstr "À vous de le déduire des graphiques"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:693
msgid "Yours to work out from the data"
msgstr "À vous de le déduire des données"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:693
msgid "Shown separately for every statement"
msgstr "Indiqué séparément pour chaque affirmation"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:694
msgid "Too few answers to be sure?"
msgstr "Trop peu de réponses pour en être sûr ?"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:694
msgid "Left for you to judge"
msgstr "Laissé à votre appréciation"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:694
msgid "Said plainly, statement by statement"
msgstr "Dit clairement, affirmation par affirmation"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:695
msgid "Priced by"
msgstr "Tarifé selon"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:695
msgid "Plan, each with a cap on participants"
msgstr "Offre, chacune avec un plafond de participants"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:695
msgid "Presenter seat"
msgstr "Licence présentateur"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:695
msgid "Seat, often with a limit on responses"
msgstr "Licence, souvent avec une limite de réponses"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:695
#, python-format
msgid "%(price)s for 30 days, any number of participants"
msgstr "%(price)s pour 30 jours, quel que soit le nombre de participants"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:696
msgid "Choose it when"
msgstr "À choisir quand"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:696
msgid "You want the audience’s questions, voted up"
msgstr "Vous voulez les questions du public, classées par vote"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:696
msgid "You want a lively, interactive presentation"
msgstr "Vous voulez une présentation vivante et interactive"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:696
msgid "You need detailed answers from each person"
msgstr "Vous avez besoin de réponses détaillées de chaque personne"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:696
msgid "You have a decision to make and need to know where people stand"
msgstr ""
"Vous avez une décision à prendre et besoin de savoir où se situent les gens"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:698
#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:708
msgid "Survey forms"
msgstr "Formulaires d’enquête"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:717
msgid "Society Speaks compared with Slido, Mentimeter and survey forms"
msgstr ""
"Society Speaks comparé à Slido, Mentimeter et aux formulaires d’enquête"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:720
msgid "Compared on"
msgstr "Comparé sur"

#: app/templates/consultations/landing.html:738
msgid ""
"Many organisations use more than one: a live poll to warm up the room, a "
"consultation for the question that matters. Survey forms here means tools "
"such as Google Forms, Microsoft Forms and SurveyMonkey."
