#: app/templates/help/daily_brief.html:5 app/templates/help/daily_brief.html:8
#: app/templates/help/daily_brief.html:10
msgid ""
"The free Society Speaks Daily Brief: 3–5 civic stories from 140+ sources, "
"spectrum breakdown, and under-reported coverage."
msgstr ""
"Le Daily Brief gratuit de Society Speaks : 3–5 histoires civiques provenant "
"de plus de 140 sources, analyse du spectre et couverture sous-estimée."

#: app/templates/help/daily_brief.html:16
msgid ""
"A free, ad-free editorial digest — not personalised algorithmic news. "
"Stories are chosen for civic impact, not virality."
msgstr ""
"Un digest éditorial gratuit, sans publicités — pas d'actualités "
